=head1 NAME

check_pgbouncer - pgBouncer plugin for Nagios

=head1 SYNOPSIS

  check_pgbouncer {-w|--warning THRESHOLD} {-c|--critical THRESHOLD} [-s|--service SERVICE ] [-h|--host HOST] [-U|--username ROLE] [-p|--port PORT] [-d|--dbname DATABASE] [-S|--dbservice SERVICE_NAME] [-P|--psql PATH] [--debug]
  check_pgbouncer [-l|--list]
  check_pgbouncer [--help]

=head1 DESCRIPTION

check_pgbouncer is designed to monitor pgBouncer service from Nagios. It offers
many options to measure and monitor useful performance metrics.

=head1 COMPATIBILITY

Each service is available from a different pgBouncer version.

Ideally, the psql client should be 8.4 at least. If your client is older, see
C<--psql> and C<--old-psql> for more information.

Please report any undocumented incompatibility.

=cut

